# ai.wing — CPK Fire and Security Systems

New premium one-pager, designed independently.
Content harvest run: **2026-08-20** against `https://www.cpkfire.com/`.

The live site is a **content source only**. Its layout, section order, navigation,
typography, spacing and visual treatment are not carried over. The single
visual carryover is the logo's accent red — see Section 2.

---

## 0. Harvest method (Section 1 hard gate — PASSED)

The live site is an **Angular SPA** (`<app-root>`, AOT bundles). A plain `curl`
returns a 6.2 KB shell with no body content, exactly as the brief predicted.

**Tool used:** Playwright + Chromium (`chromium-1223`), scripts `extract.js` /
`extract2.js`.

- `npx playwright install chromium` failed mid-download on the newest revision;
  resolved by pointing `executablePath` at the already-present `chromium-1223`.
  Rendering then worked fully.
- Home page rendered **4,156 characters** of real text, **18 `<img>`** elements
  and 2 CSS background images → gate passed. No invented content required.
- Cross-checked against the Angular `main.*.js` string table and
  `assets/css/style.css`; both agree with the rendered DOM.

### Site shape found
The live site is already a single page — `Home / About / Products / Portfolio /
Contact` are in-page anchors. Every other route was probed and returns a
13-character `404 Not Found`:

`/about`, `/services`, `/products`, `/contact`, `/gallery`, `/projects`, `/clients`

There is no additional published content anywhere. What follows is the complete
corpus.

---

## 1. What was deliberately NOT carried over

| Old site | New build |
|---|---|
| Nunito + Open Sans | **Sora + Inter** — geometric grotesque display, neutral body |
| Warm-plum neutrals (`#493C3E`, `#444444`, `#777777`, `#F6F4F4`) | **Cool slate scale** on white / `#F9FAFB` |
| Rose accent `#E43C5C` (template default) | **Dropped.** Accent now derives from the logo only |
| Nav: Home / About / Products / Portfolio / Contact | **Company / Systems / Credentials / Equipment / Contact** |
| Hero: "Distributors of fire and security systems" | **"Every system that keeps a building safe."** |
| Section order: Hero → About → Products → Partners → CTA → Portfolio → Contact | **Hero → Company → Systems → Credentials → Equipment → Contact** |
| Bootstrap card rows, uniform 3-up grids | Hairline-seam bento (7/5, 5/7, 6/6), numbered tiles, CSS-columns masonry |
| Full-lockup logo scaled down until illegible | Circular mark + wordmark set in type |

An earlier iteration of this build did inherit the old typography, neutrals and
section order. That was corrected — this file describes the current state.

---

## 2. Colour — one carryover, everything else new

### The carryover
| Token | Value | Source |
|---|---|---|
| `brand-600` | `#E42128` | **Sampled from the real logo asset.** Canvas pixel histogram over `assets/img/logo/logo.png`; dominant ink cluster `rgb(240,40,48)`–`rgb(216,32,40)`, centre ≈ `#E42128` |

`brand-50` … `brand-900` are tints and shades **derived here** from that single
sampled value. The old site's `#E43C5C` / `#D01D3F` / `#FDEFF2` accents are not
used.

### The new neutral system
Cool slate on a white base, per brief Section 4 — `#FFFFFF` base, `#F9FAFB`
alternating sections, `#0F172A` text. `slate-50` through `slate-900` are the
standard cool-slate ramp. **No old-site neutral appears in this build.**

**Fallback not used.** The brief's inferred `~#E63946` was unnecessary — a real
logo value was recovered.

### Typography — new, not extracted
**Sora** (display, 500–800) + **Inter** (body, 400–600). Chosen for this build:
Sora is a precise geometric grotesque that suits life-safety equipment. The old
site's Nunito/Open Sans pairing is deliberately not used.

