## 4. Images — 100% first-party

Every image is downloaded and served from `/public/images/`.
**No hotlinks to cpkfire.com. No stock. No placeholders. No lorem ipsum.**

### Brand
| File | Source |
|---|---|
| `brand/logo.png` | `assets/img/logo/logo.png` — 3000×2000 transparent PNG, original untouched |
| `brand/favicon.png` | `assets/img/logo/favicon.png` — tab icon |
| `brand/logo-mark.png` | **DERIVED from `logo.png`** — circular CPK mark auto-cropped by alpha-bounding-box + row-gap detection, squared, downscaled to 512×512 (1.58 MB → 154 KB). A crop of the real asset; no pixels redrawn. Needed because the full lockup's `FIRE AND SECURITY SYSTEMS PVT LTD` tagline renders at ~6 px in a navbar |

### Photography
| File | Source | Used in |
|---|---|---|
| `hero-bg.jpg` | live hero CSS background | Hero, full-bleed with GSAP parallax |
| `cta-bg.jpg` | live CTA CSS background | **DOWNLOADED, DELIBERATELY UNUSED** — it is a stock photo of a design workshop (markers, magazine cut-outs), unreplaced template filler with no relation to fire or security |

### Partner logos (8)
`bosch.png`, `Siemens.png`, `hid.png`, `aa.png`, `xtralis.svg`, `mp.jpg`,
`ebss.png`, `ss.jpeg` — Credentials marquee, plus Bosch featured in the badge card.

### Product photography (9)
The live site publishes these **unlabelled** (`alt=""`) with no project names,
clients or dates. Each was **visually identified** by opening the file. Captions
in the build describe the hardware pictured — **no project is claimed anywhere**.

| File | Identified as | Basis |
|---|---|---|
| `fa_3.jpg` | Fire alarm panel & field devices | Hochiki panel + detectors + sounder + call point |
| `ac_2.jpg` | HID iCLASS SE readers & credentials | HID branding + "iCLASS Seos" card |
| `pava_1.jpg` | Bosch PAVA amplifiers & call station | Bosch branding visible |
| `cc_3.jpg` | IR dome surveillance camera | visual |
| `ac_7.jpg` | Assa Abloy proximity reader | "ASSA ABLOY" printed on unit |
| `1.jpeg` | Optical smoke & heat detector | visual |
| `dd.jpg` | RFID hotel door lock | visual |
| `4.jpeg` | HID AERO access controller | "HID" + "AERO X200" printed on board |
| `aa.jpg` | VESDA aspirating smoke detection | "VESDA" printed on panel |

All nine corroborated by the live site's own filename prefixes (`fa_`, `ac_`,
`cc_`, `pava_`) and by manufacturers the live About copy already names.

### Unsplash — attempted, blocked
Brief Section 7 permits Unsplash for sections the old site has no equivalent
content for. **Unsplash is behind bot detection**: both
`unsplash.com/napi/search/photos` and `unsplash.com/s/photos/*` return an
interstitial (`HTTP 401`, "Making sure you're not a bot!"). Bypassing bot
detection is out of scope, so no third-party stock was used and no Lorem Picsum
placeholder was introduced. Every image in the build is a real CPK asset.

